     "+ дієслово з -ing: <b>watching</b>.",
     "Відповідь: she <b>was watching</b> TV."
    ]
   },
   "alt": "<p>Це Present Continuous, «перенесений у минуле»: am / is → <b>was</b>, are → <b>were</b>.</p>\n        <p>I am reading → I <b>was</b> reading. They are playing → they <b>were</b> playing.</p>",
